    {
      "Uid": 26,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_21_AGN_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "여정의 난이도가 생각보다 어려웠던 걸까?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "旅の難易度が、思ったよりも高かったのかしら？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 27,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_21_AGN_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아니면 뭔가 잘못된 선택을 했던 걸까?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あるいは、何か選択を誤ったのかしら？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 28,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_21_AGN_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아무튼 너도 알다시피 이 정도로는 부족해.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "いずれにせよ、これではまだ足りないわ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 29,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_21_AGN_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "너에게도, 네가 선택한 아이에게도…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あなたにとっても、あなたが選んだ子にとっても…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 30,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_21_AGN_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그리고 식어가는 이 우주에게도.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そして、冷えゆくこの宇宙にとっても。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 31,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_21_AGN_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "다음에는 좀 더 나은 결과를 기대할게.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "次は、良い結果を期待しているわ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 32,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_21_AGN_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그럼 그때까지 잠시나마 편히 쉬렴.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "それまで、少し休むことね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 33,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_21_AGN_BT_DEFEAT",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나의 벗, 나의 계약자…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私の友、私の契約者…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 34,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_PF_21_AGN_BT_DEFEAT",
